# High Stride: "Target creature" is any creature, an opponent's included, and "until end of turn" ends with the turn it was cast
# in (CR 514.2, 611.2a). Bot2's untapped Elvish Mystic is 2/4 with reach after Bot1's T3 cast, and a plain 1/1 again at Bot2's
# next turn (T4); it stays untapped through the untap instruction (CR 701.26a). The same creature on an earlier turn would not
# have changed, so the T4 check is against the base values.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Forest
High Stride
Forest x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Elvish Mystic
Forest x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Elvish Mystic.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest#1.Activate
Bot1.Hand.High Stride.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Elvish Mystic)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot2.Battlefield.Elvish Mystic.Power = 2
? Bot2.Battlefield.Elvish Mystic.Toughness = 4
? Bot2.Battlefield.Elvish Mystic.Keywords = Reach
? Bot2.Battlefield.Elvish Mystic.Tapped = false
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
? Bot2.Battlefield.Elvish Mystic.Power = 1
? Bot2.Battlefield.Elvish Mystic.Toughness = 1
? Bot2.Battlefield.Elvish Mystic.Keywords = (absent)

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = High Stride
Bot2.Battlefield.Elvish Mystic.Power = 1
